1
00:00:01,290 --> 00:00:02,420
My name is Lara.

2
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:06,090
I'm the Little Mermaid
resurrected after 200 years.

3
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:08,090
But I've lost everything.

4
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:11,510
The ocean, my family, and
everything that binds them.

5
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:14,100
The light...
To bring them back,

6
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:16,680
I must do whatever
I can to find true love.

7
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:19,230
I was unable to find
true love back then,

8
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:21,400
but this time I know I will.

9
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,320
And that is why...

10
00:00:23,730 --> 00:00:25,940
I've decided to look
for my prince again,

11
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,150
right here in Shiga!

12
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:29,030
[sighs]

13
00:00:32,990 --> 00:00:34,030
See you later.

14
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:39,000
[♪ rousing orchestral
music begins]

15
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:40,500
My name is Mari.

16
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:43,080
I'm a freshman at
Zeze Minami High School.

17
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:45,340
I run every morning at 5 a.m.

18
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:48,590
My favorite things are my
pet Gon-chan and boxing.

19
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:50,550
[grunts]

20
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:53,010
I started boxing
with my brother.

21
00:00:53,390 --> 00:00:55,300
And I've been doing it
for 10 years.

22
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:58,180
My goal is to be stronger
than anyone else.

23
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:01,230
I won't let anyone get in
my way, no matter what.

24
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,060
[grunting continues]

25
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:07,320
[♪ upbeat music]

26
00:01:10,530 --> 00:01:13,360
[NAGAHAMA] Well, well, well,
look who's full of energy.

27
00:01:15,870 --> 00:01:17,240
[MARI] She is Nagahama.

28
00:01:18,290 --> 00:01:20,330
[NAGAHAMA] Undefeated
in official matches.

29
00:01:20,370 --> 00:01:23,420
I'm the champ in this town.
Nice try, Otsu.

30
00:01:30,010 --> 00:01:31,340
I really don't like you.

31
00:01:32,170 --> 00:01:34,220
[LARA] Mari!

32
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:36,390
[panting]

33
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:39,640
What an idiot.

34
00:01:41,390 --> 00:01:43,520
[♪ opening music begins]

35
00:03:07,980 --> 00:03:10,110
[♪ opening music ends]

36
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:13,440
Mmm! So good!

37
00:03:13,490 --> 00:03:15,900
This thing you call
rice is delicious!

38
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:18,620
Well, don't worry, it's
not going anywhere.

39
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:21,490
Mari's friend really does
enjoy eating rice.

40
00:03:21,530 --> 00:03:23,910
Well, it certainly takes
some guts to stick with

41
00:03:23,950 --> 00:03:26,160
Shiga's very own top
boxer the way you have.

42
00:03:26,210 --> 00:03:28,040
-Stick with?
-Here, have some of this.

43
00:03:28,290 --> 00:03:29,290
What is it?

44
00:03:30,210 --> 00:03:32,500
Mmm! Whatever, it is delicious!

45
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,970
What am I going to do?

46
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:42,810
I've brought a mermaid
home with me, and she's weird.

47
00:03:46,190 --> 00:03:49,480
I'm heading out for the day.
I'll be back later this evening.

48
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:52,190
[door opens and closes]

49
00:03:55,530 --> 00:03:56,490
[LARA] Hey, Mari!

50
00:03:57,530 --> 00:03:58,570
Where are you going?

51
00:03:59,490 --> 00:04:02,740
-School?
-Say, Mari, what is... school?

52
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:07,000
It's a place where
people gather.

53
00:04:07,870 --> 00:04:09,210
So how many people?

54
00:04:09,540 --> 00:04:11,090
[LARA] Ten? Twenty?

55
00:04:11,540 --> 00:04:13,750
I'd say there's around 600.

56
00:04:14,090 --> 00:04:15,380
[gasps]

57
00:04:16,550 --> 00:04:19,050
[LARA] So then is school the
name of a kingdom?

58
00:04:19,260 --> 00:04:20,220
[MARI] You idiot.

59
00:04:23,180 --> 00:04:25,310
[grunts]

60
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:27,940
[punching bag thudding]

61
00:04:28,140 --> 00:04:30,390
[grunting]

62
00:04:32,020 --> 00:04:33,110
More!

63
00:04:34,020 --> 00:04:35,020
More!

64
00:04:35,610 --> 00:04:36,570
Harder!

65
00:04:36,820 --> 00:04:37,690
Faster!

66
00:04:38,030 --> 00:04:38,990
Stronger!

67
00:04:39,030 --> 00:04:40,820
[♪ dramatic music]

68
00:04:42,370 --> 00:04:44,990
Believe me, I know exactly what
children these days are like.

69
00:04:45,450 --> 00:04:47,500
But, how many times has
this happened now?

70
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:50,420
Offering cake to apologize
simply won't cut it.

71
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,040
[MARI] Hm.

72
00:04:54,290 --> 00:04:55,250
[sighs]

73
00:04:56,210 --> 00:04:58,170
You've been fighting with
your school friends a lot,

74
00:04:58,210 --> 00:05:00,510
so the house is
full of Baumkuchen.

75
00:05:01,510 --> 00:05:04,470
If you keep picking fights,
Mom's going to get really fat.

76
00:05:05,220 --> 00:05:07,350
It's fine because I really
like Baumkuchen.

77
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:11,020
Well, I really prefer kind kids

78
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:13,610
who don't fight just to
get some Baumkuchen.

79
00:05:14,310 --> 00:05:16,150
It's not fair.
I did nothing wrong.

80
00:05:17,020 --> 00:05:18,070
[sighs]

81
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:24,280
Hey, Mari.

82
00:05:25,070 --> 00:05:26,740
What do you say
we have a fight?

83
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,250
A fight?

84
00:05:28,290 --> 00:05:30,120
Whoever looks away first loses.

85
00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:32,580
If you lose, you have to do
whatever I say.

86
00:05:32,620 --> 00:05:33,580
Right, let's go.

87
00:05:33,830 --> 00:05:35,960
Hmm.

88
00:05:36,170 --> 00:05:37,710
Ah!

89
00:05:37,750 --> 00:05:39,130
All right, looks like
I win the game.

90
00:05:39,170 --> 00:05:41,050
[MARI] You cheated!
Let's play again!

91
00:05:41,090 --> 00:05:44,340
Oh, no way. I say Mari
can't fight anymore, okay?

92
00:05:45,050 --> 00:05:46,970
That's not fair though!
You cheated!

93
00:05:47,010 --> 00:05:50,640
[Mari's mom giggles] Whoever
looks away first loses!

94
00:05:52,350 --> 00:05:53,690
-Hey, Otsu!
-Ah?

95
00:05:54,350 --> 00:05:55,730
Gonna stand there all day?

96
00:05:56,810 --> 00:05:59,280
Oh, my bad. I didn't know
you were waiting.

97
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:01,280
Please try to follow
the gym rules.

98
00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:04,910
-Yeah.
-What's with... that look?

99
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,910
-Huh?
-Looks like you wanna say

100
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:08,870
something, but you're
trying not to.

101
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:11,450
[MARI] No. What are
you getting at?

102
00:06:11,500 --> 00:06:13,170
Can't you both go a day without

103
00:06:13,210 --> 00:06:14,420
getting into an argument?

104
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,080
We're not arguing!

105
00:06:16,670 --> 00:06:19,500
Otsu is doing the same workout
as the 2nd and 3rd years!

106
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,880
You can win the
nationals by doing

107
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,380
the same training as a rookie.

108
00:06:24,130 --> 00:06:25,970
But she's just doing
middle school stuff!

109
00:06:26,010 --> 00:06:28,430
[COACH] Nagahama, is it
really a captain's job

110
00:06:28,970 --> 00:06:30,430
to nitpick the underclassmen?

111
00:06:31,230 --> 00:06:32,980
-No, Coach.
-Then it's fine.

112
00:06:33,310 --> 00:06:35,020
And Otsu, you're not innocent.

113
00:06:35,060 --> 00:06:37,560
You two need to pay attention
and behave yourselves.

114
00:06:38,310 --> 00:06:39,400
Right.

115
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:44,360
[LADY WITCH] The true love that
you once longed for so much

116
00:06:45,570 --> 00:06:48,280
was never meant to be
because the prince rejected you.

117
00:06:49,370 --> 00:06:50,990
You need to get over that,

118
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:53,330
overcome the pain and
fear that you felt back then.

119
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,120
In that case...

120
00:06:56,170 --> 00:06:59,040
You must make it your
priority to find a new prince.

121
00:06:59,380 --> 00:07:01,630
-A new prince?
-Exactly.

122
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:04,630
You need to find a new love with
a human somewhere.

123
00:07:05,340 --> 00:07:09,180
Only then... are you able
to save your entire family.

124
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:12,430
[magical chimes]

125
00:07:14,270 --> 00:07:17,270
-I know, but I'm scared.
-Of what?

126
00:07:17,730 --> 00:07:21,230
[LARA] Venturing into the
outside world... without Mari.

127
00:07:21,770 --> 00:07:25,240
My, how pathetic! Don't you
want to save your family?

128
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:27,950
You don't have time to be
worrying about things like this.

129
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:30,620
But if you're worried,
well, then...

130
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,990
just get Mari to help you.

131
00:07:33,450 --> 00:07:36,250
Yes, she can be a difficult
girl, but if you trick her

132
00:07:36,290 --> 00:07:38,710
well enough, then you
can get her to do anything.

133
00:07:40,130 --> 00:07:41,170
Hmm?

134
00:07:42,380 --> 00:07:43,380
Lara?

135
00:07:45,210 --> 00:07:48,220
That's it! There's no way
I can carry on like this.

136
00:07:49,470 --> 00:07:52,560
I need to do what I can to
understand this new world.

137
00:07:54,060 --> 00:07:55,600
I need to connect more

138
00:07:56,350 --> 00:07:57,600
and not be afraid!

139
00:07:58,940 --> 00:08:00,360
I have to give it my all

140
00:08:01,730 --> 00:08:03,690
and learn everything
about humans.

141
00:08:05,070 --> 00:08:06,280
[water running]

142
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:10,570
Wow, that's... water!

143
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:14,290
Hey, Otsu,
you're just a junior, right?

144
00:08:14,950 --> 00:08:16,250
I was fresh from being so cocky.

145
00:08:16,290 --> 00:08:18,210
What are they
arguing about now?

146
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:21,330
They're discussing whether
to tape the gloves or not.

147
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:23,500
-Hmm.
-Uh, hey, Coach.

148
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,420
Can't you do something?

149
00:08:26,260 --> 00:08:28,090
The tournament
is coming up soon.

150
00:08:28,930 --> 00:08:30,630
-Otsu, Nagahama!
-Hmm?

151
00:08:31,300 --> 00:08:33,390
You're both in the same
weight class, right?

152
00:08:33,430 --> 00:08:34,510
Uh-huh.

153
00:08:35,350 --> 00:08:37,850
The thing is, we're only sending
one of you to the match.

154
00:08:37,890 --> 00:08:39,270
[both gasp]

155
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:42,440
We'll have a sparring
session tomorrow.

156
00:08:43,230 --> 00:08:46,280
Whoever wins will be the one to
go to the match.

157
00:08:47,490 --> 00:08:50,450
-Don't run away.
-I wouldn't dream of it.

158
00:08:50,950 --> 00:08:52,490
Ah...

159
00:08:52,530 --> 00:08:55,280
[Coach sighs] I'm looking
forward to tomorrow.

160
00:08:57,910 --> 00:08:59,790
-I'm home.
-What a mess!

161
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:05,250
Wipe down every single
spot you walked on.

162
00:09:05,290 --> 00:09:06,670
Okay.

163
00:09:07,170 --> 00:09:08,260
[Mari sighs]

164
00:09:08,300 --> 00:09:09,380
[Ema grumbles]

165
00:09:10,170 --> 00:09:12,260
Gon-chan, what is her problem?

166
00:09:12,300 --> 00:09:14,550
-I don't understand her.
-Oh, cut her some slack.

167
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,550
She's a mermaid.

168
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:16,850
And?

169
00:09:16,890 --> 00:09:18,390
-[LARA] Mari!
-[MARI] Huh?

170
00:09:20,350 --> 00:09:22,480
It looks like I need
something called money.

171
00:09:23,060 --> 00:09:24,980
I've got no idea what
he's talking about.

172
00:09:25,020 --> 00:09:26,360
What's going on out there?

173
00:09:26,940 --> 00:09:27,690
Nothing!

174
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:30,240
[LARA] Haru is really amazing.

175
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:32,570
I just ask for things and look!

176
00:09:33,370 --> 00:09:35,530
You've gotta be kidding me.
What did you do?

177
00:09:35,910 --> 00:09:38,500
I just asked for some cake.
You like cake too, right?

178
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,870
That's what Lady Witch
told me anyway.

179
00:09:41,250 --> 00:09:43,040
I actually first had
a spot of cake

180
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,710
a very long time ago and... oh!

181
00:09:45,460 --> 00:09:47,040
This one has a weird shape.

182
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:49,710
[thud]
[Mari groans]

183
00:09:50,220 --> 00:09:51,220
Clear your head.

184
00:09:52,170 --> 00:09:54,550
Don't think about anything.
Clear your head.

185
00:09:55,390 --> 00:09:56,300
Don't look away.

186
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:57,680
Not for a second.

187
00:09:59,140 --> 00:10:02,020
[crowd cheering on TV]
[YOSHIYA] Oh yeah!

188
00:10:03,390 --> 00:10:04,940
[YOSHIYA] That's so cool.

189
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:06,980
-[Mari gasps]
- Yeah.

190
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:09,480
[MARI] Hey Mom,
let's have a fight.

191
00:10:09,530 --> 00:10:11,190
Huh?

192
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,650
If you look away, you must
do whatever I say.

193
00:10:12,990 --> 00:10:14,110
Oh, no way!

194
00:10:14,150 --> 00:10:15,200
[Mari sighs]

195
00:10:17,580 --> 00:10:20,580
[Mari grunts]

196
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:22,210
What's the matter?

197
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,210
I lost.

198
00:10:24,250 --> 00:10:25,710
Well, that doesn't matter.

199
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:30,170
I want to go and try boxing.

200
00:10:30,380 --> 00:10:31,510
Huh?

201
00:10:32,510 --> 00:10:34,090
I want to try boxing.

202
00:10:35,470 --> 00:10:38,100
Sure, you've been watching it
quite a lot lately, but...

203
00:10:38,430 --> 00:10:39,600
that's pretty sudden.

204
00:10:40,010 --> 00:10:41,600
-You sure?
-Mm-hmm.

205
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:45,100
Why didn't you tell
me you wanted this?

206
00:10:47,110 --> 00:10:50,650
Because Mom says she likes
kids who don't get into fights.

207
00:10:53,450 --> 00:10:57,120
Mari, the thing that I really
hate the most is

208
00:10:57,530 --> 00:11:00,080
kids who look away
when it really matters.

209
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:03,290
It's perfectly fine to do
what you like, Mari.

210
00:11:04,410 --> 00:11:07,710
But if you look away for one
second, you lose.

211
00:11:09,340 --> 00:11:12,710
I'm sorry, uh, did I
distract you there?

212
00:11:13,970 --> 00:11:15,220
[Lara shouts]

213
00:11:15,670 --> 00:11:17,430
How about that kid?
You really need

214
00:11:17,470 --> 00:11:19,550
to let me get in
touch with her parents.

215
00:11:20,300 --> 00:11:23,100
I can't just let her stay here
without knowing the reason why.

216
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:25,270
Yeah.

217
00:11:25,310 --> 00:11:27,440
If you find it hard to talk
about, I will tell them.

218
00:11:28,270 --> 00:11:29,270
It's okay.

219
00:11:29,980 --> 00:11:31,020
Is that so?

220
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:34,190
Hey, Mari, are you okay?

221
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:35,530
Huh?

222
00:11:36,150 --> 00:11:38,160
I've noticed you've been
a bit on edge lately.

223
00:11:38,700 --> 00:11:40,330
You worry too much, Grandma.

224
00:11:42,030 --> 00:11:44,250
It's just... there's a big
match coming up.

225
00:11:47,410 --> 00:11:48,500
[LARA] Mari!

226
00:11:48,540 --> 00:11:50,960
[Lara panting] Mari!

227
00:11:51,130 --> 00:11:53,250
Wait! Mari!

228
00:11:53,500 --> 00:11:55,510
[Lara panting]

229
00:11:56,470 --> 00:11:58,630
Finally, I caught up with you.

230
00:11:59,340 --> 00:12:00,390
Gee, you're fast.

231
00:12:02,970 --> 00:12:05,680
Hey, why are you following me?

232
00:12:06,180 --> 00:12:07,600
Oh, that's not it.

233
00:12:08,310 --> 00:12:09,440
I thought you might have

234
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:11,570
forgotten something.
This, I mean.

235
00:12:12,020 --> 00:12:13,480
You always carry it, right?

236
00:12:16,030 --> 00:12:17,150
What are you doing?

237
00:12:18,900 --> 00:12:21,120
I don't bring it
every time I go for a run.

238
00:12:21,490 --> 00:12:22,410
Oh, really?

239
00:12:22,620 --> 00:12:23,620
I'm sorry.

240
00:12:24,030 --> 00:12:25,330
-Hey.
-Huh?

241
00:12:25,790 --> 00:12:27,500
What are you planning to do now?

242
00:12:28,500 --> 00:12:30,460
I don't know what
Gon-chan told you, but

243
00:12:30,500 --> 00:12:33,130
I can't let you stay in
my room much longer.

244
00:12:33,170 --> 00:12:34,210
[gasps]

245
00:12:35,250 --> 00:12:36,300
[sighs]

246
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:40,680
Right.

247
00:12:42,220 --> 00:12:45,350
I'm sorry, but please
stop following me.

248
00:12:52,230 --> 00:12:54,190
[magical chimes]

249
00:12:59,030 --> 00:13:00,570
[shower running]

250
00:13:03,450 --> 00:13:05,450
Whoa! What are you doing?

251
00:13:05,950 --> 00:13:08,370
Being like this makes
me feel calm.

252
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:11,160
I'm sorry.

253
00:13:11,500 --> 00:13:12,460
Hey, wait!

254
00:13:12,500 --> 00:13:13,670
Um, did... Ah!

255
00:13:14,210 --> 00:13:15,590
Dry yourself first!

256
00:13:17,250 --> 00:13:19,090
[LADY WITCH] You made
Mari angry?

257
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:21,430
And you're going
to be kicked out?

258
00:13:22,050 --> 00:13:23,300
This isn't going well.

259
00:13:24,300 --> 00:13:26,640
If you carry on like this,
the chance of finding true love

260
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:28,430
will be nothing
but a pipe dream.

261
00:13:29,230 --> 00:13:32,480
However, I suppose if you want
to borrow my power again...

262
00:13:33,100 --> 00:13:34,690
Hey, Lady Witch?

263
00:13:35,730 --> 00:13:37,610
How did you meet Mari
in the first place?

264
00:13:38,150 --> 00:13:40,610
Hmm? Hmph. Just by chance.

265
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:43,320
She simply found me
and brought me here.

266
00:13:43,910 --> 00:13:47,120
I guess my appearance must have
seemed slightly unusual to her.

267
00:13:48,290 --> 00:13:50,540
What about this place?
Do you like living here?

268
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:52,120
[LADY WITCH] Oh no!

269
00:13:52,670 --> 00:13:54,540
I can't wait for the day
that I can get out

270
00:13:54,580 --> 00:13:56,420
of this cramped place.

271
00:13:56,920 --> 00:14:00,010
But I did have Mari build
this aquarium for me, so...

272
00:14:00,630 --> 00:14:03,510
it's not exactly the worst
place for a fish to live.

273
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:06,640
That's it!

274
00:14:07,180 --> 00:14:08,930
I've decided.
I'm going to leave.

275
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:10,220
Huh?

276
00:14:10,430 --> 00:14:11,930
I'm nothing like Lady Witch.

277
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:14,560
I could never take
advantage of anyone.

278
00:14:15,190 --> 00:14:16,480
Hey, what are you doing?

279
00:14:17,150 --> 00:14:19,860
I can't keep relying
on others all the time.

280
00:14:21,030 --> 00:14:23,530
I won't cause any more
trouble for anyone, and

281
00:14:23,570 --> 00:14:24,780
especially not for Mari.

282
00:14:25,990 --> 00:14:27,740
Hey! Lara!

283
00:14:30,290 --> 00:14:31,370
Huh?

284
00:14:32,710 --> 00:14:35,290
All right, you two... ready?

285
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:37,080
Yeah.

286
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:39,710
[bell rings]

287
00:14:41,130 --> 00:14:44,340
[grunting] [thudding]

288
00:14:45,260 --> 00:14:47,680
[♪ intense music]

289
00:14:51,180 --> 00:14:52,310
[Nagahama grunts]

290
00:14:52,350 --> 00:14:54,020
[everyone gasps]

291
00:14:55,350 --> 00:14:56,440
I got this.

292
00:15:01,270 --> 00:15:04,030
-Hey!
-What are you?!

293
00:15:04,900 --> 00:15:06,150
What's with the luggage?

294
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:09,030
-Where are you going?
-Hey!

295
00:15:09,490 --> 00:15:12,330
Do you know where the
School Kingdom is?

296
00:15:13,290 --> 00:15:14,500
-Right there!
-She's open!

297
00:15:15,040 --> 00:15:16,670
Move!
[everyone shouting]

298
00:15:20,460 --> 00:15:21,460
[grunts]

299
00:15:22,840 --> 00:15:24,380
That's so cool, Mari!

300
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:26,630
Do you think so?

301
00:15:27,260 --> 00:15:29,140
I think it's really
cool and fun!

302
00:15:33,180 --> 00:15:34,680
[grunts]

303
00:15:34,730 --> 00:15:37,190
Here...These will make
you much stronger.

304
00:15:43,570 --> 00:15:46,030
[MARI] I won't lose to anybody!

305
00:15:47,490 --> 00:15:48,910
You won again!

306
00:15:49,530 --> 00:15:51,910
I have to keep my eyes on
the person in front of me.

307
00:15:52,990 --> 00:15:55,410
Give it your all.
Show them what you've got.

308
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:57,160
I'll give it my all.

309
00:15:57,410 --> 00:15:58,960
I'll always be my best self.

310
00:15:59,210 --> 00:16:00,170
Always!

311
00:16:00,420 --> 00:16:01,460
Nagahama!

312
00:16:02,170 --> 00:16:04,000
Everyone is so loud.

313
00:16:04,550 --> 00:16:07,010
You're making it
hard to concentrate!

314
00:16:07,220 --> 00:16:09,300
[bell rings]

315
00:16:25,900 --> 00:16:28,200
[everyone cheering]
What are you looking?!

316
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:32,700
[grunting] [thudding]

317
00:16:33,370 --> 00:16:34,620
My rhythm's off?!

318
00:16:36,160 --> 00:16:38,040
-All right!
- Shut up!

319
00:16:38,290 --> 00:16:39,250
Nagahama!

320
00:16:39,290 --> 00:16:40,330
[MARI] Shut up!

321
00:16:40,880 --> 00:16:42,000
Everyone shut up!

322
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:43,500
-Shut up!
-Mari!

323
00:16:44,290 --> 00:16:45,500
-Mari!
-Shut up!

324
00:16:46,170 --> 00:16:47,210
[gasps]

325
00:16:50,300 --> 00:16:52,680
I don't understand
what's happening here!

326
00:16:53,350 --> 00:16:55,560
Stop this at once!
Stop killing each other!

327
00:16:57,180 --> 00:17:00,100
I won't let you hurt Mari, so
leave her alone, okay?

328
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:09,070
You idiot!
You can't step in the ring!

329
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:11,660
-Why, Mari?
-What are you doing here?

330
00:17:12,450 --> 00:17:14,620
Oh, um, one moment.

331
00:17:15,790 --> 00:17:19,000
Yoshiya bought this for me
earlier, but... Here.

332
00:17:19,660 --> 00:17:21,920
I've decided I'm
going to move out,

333
00:17:23,250 --> 00:17:26,090
so I wanted to thank you for
everything you've done for me.

334
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:27,710
Thank you.

335
00:17:33,010 --> 00:17:33,970
But wait...

336
00:17:34,510 --> 00:17:36,100
What's going on here?

337
00:17:37,560 --> 00:17:39,640
Does everybody here
really hate you?

338
00:17:42,190 --> 00:17:45,480
[laughing]

339
00:17:52,570 --> 00:17:56,330
[MARI] Listen... I know I'm not
very good at being considerate,

340
00:17:56,990 --> 00:17:58,790
so I end up causing
trouble for everyone.

341
00:17:59,910 --> 00:18:01,160
But when boxing...

342
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:05,500
I want to face it head-on,
with dignity and pride.

343
00:18:06,630 --> 00:18:09,300
But just now, I dropped
my concentration

344
00:18:09,550 --> 00:18:11,130
and acted pathetically.

345
00:18:12,010 --> 00:18:14,680
So, I'm sorry that
I looked away.

346
00:18:15,470 --> 00:18:17,680
Please give me one more round!

347
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:21,350
Oh man, you're such
an unlikable brat.

348
00:18:23,020 --> 00:18:24,020
Let's keep going.

349
00:18:26,060 --> 00:18:29,980
[MARI] Lara... yesterday
I was a bit on edge.

350
00:18:30,150 --> 00:18:31,230
I'm sorry,

351
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:35,200
but from now on, just keep
your eyes on me.

352
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:39,200
[bell rings]

353
00:18:40,330 --> 00:18:42,370
[cheering]

354
00:18:43,370 --> 00:18:45,500
I gotta say,
they're two of a kind.

355
00:18:45,830 --> 00:18:47,590
[cheering]

356
00:18:49,590 --> 00:18:51,550
[grunting] [thudding]

357
00:18:54,420 --> 00:18:55,720
[bell rings]

358
00:18:56,890 --> 00:18:58,600
Just be more
careful from now on.

359
00:19:00,930 --> 00:19:02,020
I really don't get it.

360
00:19:02,350 --> 00:19:03,560
So we both passed?

361
00:19:04,350 --> 00:19:06,060
I mean, I definitely beat her.

362
00:19:07,060 --> 00:19:08,110
[Mari sighs]

363
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:10,270
About that...

364
00:19:10,940 --> 00:19:12,480
what were you trying to do?

365
00:19:12,990 --> 00:19:14,280
I don't want to hear critiques.

366
00:19:14,990 --> 00:19:17,240
-But what was that?
-Boxing.

367
00:19:18,070 --> 00:19:21,080
-Boxing?
-A one-on-one sport.

368
00:19:21,870 --> 00:19:22,660
[LARA] Um...

369
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,700
It's pretty cool, right?
You think?

370
00:19:25,290 --> 00:19:26,620
I don't really get it.

371
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:30,630
-So, are you really leaving?
-Yeah.

372
00:19:31,550 --> 00:19:33,960
-Do you have somewhere to go?
-Not really.

373
00:19:34,550 --> 00:19:36,050
So what are you going to do?

374
00:19:36,470 --> 00:19:37,970
I'll figure something out.

375
00:19:42,100 --> 00:19:43,390
You'll just figure it out?

376
00:19:49,190 --> 00:19:52,070
You are a mermaid who can't
live in the sea or on the land.

377
00:19:52,320 --> 00:19:53,610
That's what Gon-chan said.

378
00:19:55,030 --> 00:19:56,990
So tell me, what does that mean?

379
00:20:01,530 --> 00:20:03,620
[LARA] Well, to be honest,
I'm still scared.

380
00:20:05,080 --> 00:20:07,580
I'm scared that humans will
think I'm hideous again.

381
00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:09,670
But...

382
00:20:10,670 --> 00:20:12,340
I have made up my mind.

383
00:20:13,050 --> 00:20:15,510
I'm going to make a
life for myself.

384
00:20:17,130 --> 00:20:18,180
Uh...

385
00:20:19,890 --> 00:20:20,720
I see.

386
00:20:21,140 --> 00:20:22,140
Huh?

387
00:20:22,180 --> 00:20:23,560
We'll figure something out.

388
00:20:25,930 --> 00:20:27,560
Not sure if it'll
work out though.

389
00:20:31,150 --> 00:20:34,070
So then does that mean I can go
back to your house?

390
00:20:34,360 --> 00:20:35,440
Yeah.

391
00:20:36,110 --> 00:20:37,110
But why?

392
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:41,070
Hum, you have a point.

393
00:20:41,320 --> 00:20:42,450
I wonder why.

394
00:20:45,080 --> 00:20:47,160
Probably because
you're an idiot.

395
00:20:47,950 --> 00:20:48,660
An idiot?

396
00:20:49,370 --> 00:20:51,710
That's right.
Funny idiots are cute.

397
00:20:54,210 --> 00:20:57,050
[♪ magical music swells]

398
00:20:58,510 --> 00:21:00,630
[♪ orchestral music]

399
00:21:05,180 --> 00:21:07,310
[♪ music continues]

400
00:21:08,140 --> 00:21:10,770
[singing]

401
00:21:14,400 --> 00:21:16,070
Lady Lisa, what's that?

402
00:21:17,320 --> 00:21:18,650
That girl's heart...

403
00:21:20,030 --> 00:21:22,620
will become the light
that saves us all.

404
00:21:23,450 --> 00:21:25,530
[♪ orchestral music continues]

405
00:21:27,330 --> 00:21:29,620
[LISA] Lara, you must
find it soon.

406
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:31,540
For us...

407
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:35,040
please find true love.

408
00:21:38,260 --> 00:21:40,380
[♪ closing music begins]

409
00:23:04,170 --> 00:23:06,470
[♪ closing music ends]

410
00:23:08,140 --> 00:23:10,260
Oh! Her father is...
that's right.

411
00:23:10,310 --> 00:23:12,220
We can't get in touch
with anyone.

412
00:23:12,270 --> 00:23:14,270
So then the rest
of the family are...

413
00:23:14,310 --> 00:23:15,980
[sobs]

414
00:23:16,940 --> 00:23:17,650
Oh, I see.

415
00:23:18,860 --> 00:23:21,320
Of course, if there's anything
I can do to help at all.

416
00:23:22,530 --> 00:23:25,070
Thank you for your help
in this difficult time.

417
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:27,820
Huh. Well, that's that done.

418
00:23:28,450 --> 00:23:31,290
-Thank you very much, Gon-chan.
-That's gonna cost you.

419
00:23:32,290 --> 00:23:34,370
I have absolutely no idea
what you're talking about,

420
00:23:35,330 --> 00:23:37,460
but does that mean
I can still stay here?

421
00:23:37,500 --> 00:23:39,790
Yes, unless you slip up,
that is.

422
00:23:39,840 --> 00:23:40,670
[gasps]

423
00:23:41,670 --> 00:23:43,260
Mari, you must try this!

424
00:23:43,300 --> 00:23:44,550
-Oh...
-And this too!

425
00:23:45,340 --> 00:23:47,420
You didn't buy this with
your own money, did you?

426
00:23:48,010 --> 00:23:49,720
[LARA] Wow,
this is really delicious!

427
00:23:50,350 --> 00:23:51,970
-What's it called?
- You idiot.

428
00:23:52,010 --> 00:23:53,770
It melts in your mouth
like magic!

429
00:23:53,810 --> 00:23:55,520
Look at this one!
This is the first

430
00:23:55,560 --> 00:23:56,520
time I've had this.

431
00:23:57,140 --> 00:23:59,020
Never seen or tasted
anything like it!
